(7699262, 1263376, 67258, '<td valign="top">I was staying with <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=149964" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pangurban</a> when the challenge was announced - and she just happens to live within driving distance of where  I grew up.   My  formative memories are   from living at Fosseway House - my bedroom had the window at the top right.  This photo is of my brother, London Grannuy, Jaimie the naughty beagle, and myself, circa Autumn  1966, or  possibly early Spring 1967.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1263632" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/67258/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1263632.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/67258/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1263632.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/67258/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1263632.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'I was staying with  pangurban when the challenge was announced - and she just happens to live within driving distance of where  I grew up.   My  formative memories are   from living at Fosseway House - my bedroom had the window at the top right.  This photo is of my brother, London Grannuy, Jaimie the naughty beagle, and myself, circa Autumn  1966, or  possibly early Spring 1967.', '2021-08-20 03:40:10.000000', NULL, 0),
