(7699267, 1263418, 114285, '<td valign="top">Im glad you are enjoying your new phone. Of course its not really the equipment its the person behind it ;)<br/> <br/>You always have such beautiful lighting incorporated into your images. I love little Toddy he looks very happy.<br/>Glad it did well for you. Beautiful image.</td>', 'Im glad you are enjoying your new phone. Of course its not really the equipment its the person behind it ;) You always have such beautiful lighting incorporated into your images. I love little Toddy he looks very happy.Glad it did well for you. Beautiful image.', '2021-08-20 03:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
